<%#
  The credits the outside data comes with, under every page of a media section. Expects: which
  ("movies" | "games").

  Films: two of these are conditions of use, not courtesy - TMDB's API terms require the "not
  endorsed or certified" line, and the IMDb datasets licence (personal, non-commercial) requires
  "Information courtesy of IMDb". Both are kept in their original English wording in every locale:
  they are licence text, not interface copy. Shikimori asks for nothing; it is credited because its
  titles are used.

  Games: Valve's and Twitch's names, stores and art are theirs; the line says where the data and
  pictures come from and that this site is not affiliated with either.
%>
<footer class="mt-16 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-900 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 space-y-1">
  <p><%= st('attribution.lead') %></p>
  <% if (typeof which !== 'undefined' && which === 'games') { %>
    <p><%= st('attribution.games') %>
      <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline hover:text-neutral-400">Steam</a>,
      <a href="https://www.twitch.tv/directory" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline hover:text-neutral-400">Twitch</a>. <%= st('attribution.notAffiliated') %></p>
  <% } else { %>
    <p>This product uses the <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline hover:text-neutral-400">TMDB</a> API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</p>
    <p>Information courtesy of <a href="https://www.imdb.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline hover:text-neutral-400">IMDb</a> (https://www.imdb.com). Used with permission.</p>
    <p><%= st('attribution.shikimori') %> <a href="https://shikimori.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline hover:text-neutral-400">Shikimori</a>.</p>
  <% } %>
</footer>
